{"message": "Localized the issue to the sign-in magic-code flow.

Root cause: In `src/pages/signin/ValidateCodeForm/BaseValidateCodeForm.tsx`, the `resendValidateCode` handler (triggered by the "Didn't receive a magic code" link) only calls `User.resendValidateCode(...)` and resets the countdown timer. It never resets/refocuses the `MagicCodeInput`, so if the user had shifted focus to another digit, focus stays there instead of returning to the first digit. `MagicCodeInput` (`src/components/MagicCodeInput.tsx`) already exposes `resetFocus()`, `focus()` and `clear()` handlers that clear state and set the focus index back to 0, which is the appropriate API to invoke from `resendValidateCode`.

The parallel forms (Contacts, AddDelegate, ValidateCodeActionModal) already call `inputValidateCodeRef.current?.clear()`/`focus()` in their own `resendValidateCode`, which further confirms the sign-in form is the missing case.", "task_completed": "true"}
